  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_01",
      "hash64": "D8EAE990BCF2D5B0",
      "text": "啊哈！睜大眼睛看看吧！\\n極地廣場的對戰場～！[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_02",
      "hash64": "D8EAEC90BCF2DAC9",
      "text": "……不過，這裡除了特別冷以外，\\n和其他廣場也沒啥不一樣！[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_03",
      "hash64": "D8EAEB90BCF2D916",
      "text": "我雖然是馴龍師，\\n但我挺喜歡寒冷的。[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_04",
      "hash64": "D8EAEE90BCF2DE2F",
      "text": "哎呀，話說回來，死黨，\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳是來參加四天王挑戰的嘛。[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_05",
      "hash64": "D8EAED90BCF2DC7C",
      "text": "我這裡的挑戰是\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]巨蛋限定對戰[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]！[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_06",
      "hash64": "D8EAF090BCF2E195",
      "text": "規則很簡單！\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳只要打贏聯盟社的３個學弟學妹們，\\r\\n就搞定挑戰了！[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_07",
      "hash64": "D8EAEF90BCF2DFE2",
      "text": "只是，正如其名～！\\n上場對戰的寶可夢呀～得符合條件！[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_10",
      "hash64": "D8E78490BCEFF43A",
      "text": "第一！必須是\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]在生態巨蛋捉到[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]的野生寶可夢！[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_12",
      "hash64": "D8E78290BCEFF0D4",
      "text": "第二！\\n必須是[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]自己捉到[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]的寶可夢！[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_13",
      "hash64": "D8E78390BCEFF287",
      "text": "只要同行的隊伍中有不符合\\n條件的寶可夢，就不能挑戰囉。[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_14",
      "hash64": "D8E78090BCEFED6E",
      "text": "雖然這可能有些麻煩，\\n但要是輕輕鬆鬆靠[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳手頭的存款\\r\\n一上場就打贏，也沒什麼意思嘛！[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_15",
      "hash64": "D8E78190BCEFEF21",
      "text": "當然對手也會用相同的條件努力應戰，\\n所以[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳就配合一下吧。[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_16",
      "hash64": "D8E77E90BCEFEA08",
      "text": "那好，死黨，\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳要開始四天王挑戰了嗎！？[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_select_01",
      "hash64": "2F6D9CFA77AE15BD",
      "text": "要！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_select_02",
      "hash64": "2F6D99FA77AE10A4",
      "text": "聽說明",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_select_03",
      "hash64": "2F6D9AFA77AE1257",
      "text": "下次再說",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_17",
      "hash64": "D8E77F90BCEFEBBB",
      "text": "嗯！那好，\\n學弟學妹們～出來吧～！[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_all_01",
      "hash64": "C7BA86F4AC3BE73F",
      "text": "　　　　　　　請多指教！\\n多多關照喔～！　　　　　麻煩了唷！[VAR 0x0114(004D)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_18",
      "hash64": "D8E77C90BCEFE6A2",
      "text": "我的挑戰，\\n宗旨就是悠～悠哉哉。[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_19",
      "hash64": "D8E77D90BCEFE855",
      "text": "想立刻開始對戰\\n也沒問題！[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_20",
      "hash64": "D8E3FE90BCECDAB1",
      "text": "想在巨蛋繞繞，\\n捉捉寶可夢也行！[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_21",
      "hash64": "D8E3FD90BCECD8FE",
      "text": "那好，輕鬆來吧！\\n大家都好好加油啊～[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_npc",
      "hash64": "9FCE05EF699E9EFA",
      "text": "想立刻開始對戰也行，\\n想轉換心情去別處晃晃也行！\\r\\n悠～悠哉哉地好好加油啊～[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_a_01",
      "hash64": "60B74CB7C5C4B4DF",
      "text": "我最喜歡茶色的寶可夢！\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳要和我對戰嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_a_04",
      "hash64": "60B747B7C5C4AC60",
      "text": "哎呀～[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的寶可夢\\n好像不符合條件！\\c\\n要在生態巨蛋！自己捉到的寶可夢！\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳只能帶這種寶可夢來喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_a_02",
      "hash64": "60B74DB7C5C4B692",
      "text": "哇喔～！多多關照喔～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_a_03",
      "hash64": "60B74EB7C5C4B845",
      "text": "剩下的對戰也好好努力吧！\\n我會送杯茶幫[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳加油的！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_b_01",
      "hash64": "377F54C3104234C8",
      "text": "我是個冷酷的女人……\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳做好……顫抖的準備了嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_b_04",
      "hash64": "377F59C310423D47",
      "text": "咦？[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的寶可夢\\n好像不符合條件耶。\\c\\n在生態巨蛋！自己捉到的寶可夢！\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳只能帶這種寶可夢來喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_b_02",
      "hash64": "377F57C3104239E1",
